# Play test of Kingsrest Isle (CIPlay kingsrest_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: up the ramp through the
# castle's gate to the lord's hall, the village and its huts, up the path to the idol on the west peak and over the rope
# bridge to the column ring on the east peak, the buried tin. Points as in its recipe.
island Kingsrest Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Bear 1
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Screecher 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5
kill Screecher
walk -40 -28 to -40 -20 to -40 -12 to -40 -4 h=12
read Stone by the gate
walk -40 0 to -41.5 5 to -41.5 8 to -41.5 10 h=12.1
read The lord's book
open The lord's chest
open Barrel in the courtyard
kill Warthog
walk 33 -46 to 33 -40 to 33 -37 to 33 -35 h=3.1
open Headman's chest
read The villagers' notice
open Barrel in the village
walk 6 -5 to 6 5 to 6 15 to 6 25 to 6 32 to 6 37 h=22
read Sign by the idol
walk 9 40 to 13.5 40 to 21 40 to 28.5 40 to 30.5 41.4 to 32.6 41.4 to 33.6 41 h=22
expect stand 33.6 41 h=22 below=24
open Offering chest
kill Bear
dig
expect animals Bear 0
expect animals Warthog 0
